00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:26.550
<v Saul Elbein>In the video, Jim is showing her credit card receipts. And even though she admitted signing them, she's suspiciously vague about the actual items she bought. And that made Jim think she was hiding something or covering for someone. She was petite, 19 years old. Not the sort of person who could beat a man to death by herself.
<v Saul Elbein>在录像中，吉姆在给她看信用卡收据。尽管她承认签了名，但她对实际购买的物品含糊其辞，这很可疑。这让吉姆觉得她在隐瞒什么或者在为某人掩盖。她身材娇小，19岁。不是那种能独自把一个男人殴打致死的人。

