00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:37.710
<v Saul Elbein>Kim said she and two friends waited for the man to get out of work and pulled him into their truck. They tried talking to him, but he wouldn't listen. He started to yell. So they decided to teach him a lesson.
<v Saul Elbein>金说她和两个朋友等着那个男人下班，把他拉进了他们的卡车。他们试图和他谈谈，但他不听。他开始大叫。所以他们决定给他一个教训。

