<v Kim>Yeah, I am. But he shouldn't have did what he did to me. He should have left me alone.
<v Kim>是的，我感到抱歉。但他不应该对我做那样的事。他应该离我远点。

00:14:51.700 --> 00:15:08.590
<v Saul Elbein>The next day, Jim brought Kim to an arraignment hearing, where she was charged with felony murder and held without bond. So, great. Full confession. Perfect cop show ending. Roll credits.
<v Saul Elbein>第二天，吉姆带着金参加了传讯听证会，她在会上被控谋杀罪，不得保释。所以，太好了。完整的告解。完美的警匪片结尾。字幕滚动。

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:17.560
<v Saul Elbein>But then after a few months in jail, Kim recanted the whole thing. She said Jim and the other interrogators had told her what to say. Again, here's Jim.
