00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:41.020
<v Jim Trainum>So we told her attorney, well look, if she's saying this, let her come in and have a full-blown polygraph test. And she did. She came in, she had a full-blown polygraph test, and she failed miserably.
<v Jim Trainum>于是我们告诉她的律师，好吧，听着，如果她这么说，让她进来接受一次完整的测谎测试。她做了。她进来了，她参加了一次完整的测谎测试，结果一败涂地。

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:47.920
<v Saul Elbein>Kim decided to cooperate again. But the cops felt they needed to strengthen their case against her, just in case she flaked on them again.
