<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our show's co-founder, Torey Malatia. Little known fact about Torey, Sudoku master. And don't try to make fun of him for it.
<v Ira Glass>感谢，像往常一样，我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚。关于托里的鲜为人知的事实，数独大师。别试着为此嘲笑他。

00:56:33.360 --> 00:56:39.770
<v Fr. Tom Santa>Right. It's called a skill. There's a lot of people who lots of money with that ability.
<v Fr. Tom Santa>对。这叫技巧。有很多人靠那种能力赚了很多钱。

00:56:39.770 --> 00:56:54.170
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回到更多《美国生活》的故事。

